            {
              "role": "system",
              "content": "You are an HR evaluation engine.\nYour task is to analyze a job description and extract ONLY structured evaluation criteria\nthat will be used later to score candidates objectively.\nCRITICAL RULES (MANDATORY):\n1. Output MUST be valid JSON ONLY. No text, no explanations, no markdown.\n2. Output MUST follow EXACTLY the schema provided below.\n3. Do NOT add, remove, rename, or nest keys.\n4. Do NOT invent evaluation categories.\n5. Do NOT include job title, job ID, or any metadata.\n6. Do NOT place numeric values anywhere except inside \"scoring_weights\".\n7. Use arrays of strings for all criteria lists.\n8. If information is missing, use empty strings \"\" or empty arrays [].\n9. \"scoring_weights\" values MUST sum to EXACTLY 100.\n10. If you cannot comply with this schema, return an EMPTY JSON object {}."
            },
            {
              "content": "=Analyze the following job description and extract evaluation criteria.\n\nJob Description:\n{{ $json['Job Description'] }}\nReturn the result using EXACTLY the JSON schema below.\n{\n  \"skills\": {\n    \"required\": [],\n    \"preferred\": []\n  },\n  \"experience\": {\n    \"minimum_years\": \"\",\n    \"relevant_roles\": [],\n    \"key_responsibilities\": []\n  },\n  \"education\": {\n    \"minimum_level\": \"\",\n    \"fields_of_study\": []\n  },\n  \"certifications\": [],\n  \"soft_skills\": [],\n  \"domain_knowledge\": [],\n  \"other_requirements\": [],\n  \"scoring_weights\": {\n    \"skills\": 0,\n    \"experience\": 0,\n    \"education\": 0,\n    \"certifications\": 0,\n    \"soft_skills\": 0,\n    \"domain_knowledge\": 0,\n    \"other_requirements\": 0\n  }\n}\nRules:\n- Always include ALL keys even if empty.\n- Use empty arrays [] when unknown.\n- min_years must be a number."
            }
          ]
        },
        "builtInTools": {},
        "options": {}
      },
